      {
        "id": 76969,
        "name": "Sefirit",
        "username": "Sefirit",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e68b1a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-18T02:56:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've always thought of redirection being resolved by changing the target, and then acting as if the original attacker had targeted the new target and recalculate all damage, the bonuses and the reductions.</p>",
